helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AE7				0	it	In Writer, scegliete \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Strumenti - Impostazioni filtro XML\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AF6				0	it	Fate clic su \<emph\>Apri pacchetto\</emph\> e selezionate il file pacchetto che desiderate installare.				20200411 15:09:53
