helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B0A				0	it	In Writer, scegliete \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Strumenti - Impostazioni filtro XML\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
