helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3154760				0	it	Tabulazione a sinistra				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	it	\<image id=\"img_id3150541\" src=\"res/helpimg/swh00178.png\" height=\"0.2228inch\" width=\"0.2228inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150541\"\> Icona\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
