helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\tablewizard00.xhp	0	help	par_idN1054C				0	it	\<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/tablewizard00.xhp\"\>Creazione guidata tabella\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\tablewizard00.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055C				0	it	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>La Creazione guidata tabella vi permette di creare una tabella di database.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
