helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149599				0	it	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_DLARROW\"\>Inserts the logical relation \<emph\>arrow with double bar pointing left\</emph\>.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>dlarrow\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_idN10525				0	it	\<image id=\"img_id3149516\" src=\"starmath/res/bi21325.png\" width=\"0.847cm\" height=\"0.847cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149516\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148707				0	it	double arrow pointing left and right				20200411 15:09:53
