helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_idN10563				0	it	\<image id=\"img_id3148697\" src=\"starmath/res/bi21326.png\" width=\"0.847cm\" height=\"0.847cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148697\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
