helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149954				0	it	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_LRFLOORX\"\>To insert floor brackets, type \<emph\>lfloor<?>rfloor\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
