helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id6054567				0	it	\<image id=\"img_id9623096\" src=\"res/helpimg/border_ca_3.png\" width=\"1.2602in\" height=\"1.5937in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id9623096\"\>bordi con una riga selezionata\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
