helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154406				0	it	PROTECT				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3145127				0	it	Restituisce lo stato della protezione delle celle.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3155794				0	it	1 = cella protetta				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3155072				0	it	0 = cella non protetta				20200411 15:09:53
