helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146944				0	it	\<bookmark_value\>ASS, funzione\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Assoluto;valore\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Valore;assoluto\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
