helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id0908200902131152				0	it	Esempio				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id090820090213112				0	it	\<item type=\"input\"\>=CONVERTI(100;"ATS";"EUR")\</item\> restituisce il valore in Euro di 100 Scellini austriaci.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id0908200902475431				0	it	=CONVERTI(100;"EUR";"DEM") converte 100 Euro in Marchi tedeschi. 				20200411 15:09:53
