helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151246				0	it	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Opzione+Comando\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt+Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Maiusc+tasti freccia				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150115				0	it	Modifica dimensione muovendo il bordo sinistro/superiore.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150129				0	it	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Comando\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab				20200411 15:09:53
