helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150952				0	it	Scegliete \<emph\>Inserisci - Indici - Indici\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150509				0	it	On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Index/Table\</item\> tab, select the name of the user-defined index that you created in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
