helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\shortcut_writing.xhp	0	help	par_id3149836	5			0	it	Premete \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Comando\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+B.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\shortcut_writing.xhp	0	help	par_id3156112	6			0	it	In alternativa, potete premere \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Comando\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+B, digitare il testo da formattare in grassetto e, al termine, premere nuovamente \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Comando\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+B.				20200411 15:09:53
