helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3155962	2			0	it	\<variable id=\"verzeichnis\"\>Le opzioni seguenti sono disponibili selezionando \<emph\>Indice analitico\</emph\> come tipo di \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120210.xhp\" name=\"indice\"\>indice\</link\>. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153247				0	it	Extra				20200411 15:09:53
